        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Felicity Jones, Diego Luna, Riz Ahmed, Ben Mendelsohn, Donnie Yen, Mads Mikkelsen, Alan Tudyk, Jiang Wen, Forest Whitaker, Rachelle Beinart\n- Works: Rogue One, The Comedy of Errors, Game of Thrones\n- Organizations: Wadham College, Oxford, Oxford University Dramatic Society, Screen Actors Guild Awards\n- Topics: acting, stunt performance, casting, education\n\nFacts:\n- Felicity Jones took time off from acting to attend Wadham College, Oxford.\n- Felicity Jones performed in Shakespeare's \"The Comedy of Errors\" for the Oxford University Dramatic Society while attending Wadham College, Oxford.\n- Felicity Jones has worked steadily since graduating in 2006.\n- Rachelle Beinart is a member of the Game of Thrones stunt teams that won two Screen Actors Guild Awards.\n- Rachelle Beinart has done stunt performances for films including Rogue One.\n- The cast of Rogue One includes Felicity Jones, Diego Luna, Riz Ahmed, Ben Mendelsohn, Donnie Yen, Mads Mikkelsen, Alan Tudyk, Jiang Wen, and Forest Whitaker.",
